{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:278ceebcc114dd99ae66d6e504d689f1387d2378302a5ad54f40fcc4639d73fc",
      "text": "撞到您了，实在非常抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b8d4c31e5d4b584b186ece286c71653c8566e72862920b25205a120f051efa",
      "text": "没有没有，我没事。我这边在路边突然停下来\n才是不好意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9a5b1fbcc71f8aa286930b8a38787c31a8c43b80a3c45fe028e5b701e4d360",
      "text": "不，我自己也没有好好看路……\n真的非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f7c11490c83386342ece8e4753f39ed8aef7b8d1d21c8c340717c1d6ec6331",
      "text": "哈哈……照这样下去，\n两个人互相道歉就没完没了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb5a594b7799fac5aadfbf87556f976a669e743dd16cba050a0fb1da9633847a",
      "text": "嗯——……对了。要说是赔礼的话，\n能不能帮我猜一下这场赛马的结果？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca9a437967d749c47f8caa0d83a7e35c492b66e3a29dac1c62a88b76a441f8e",
      "text": "赛马……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ff03751382c3834b286f5180aae64f30f59e68db688e8172fce52707c791a00",
      "text": "凭直觉就行，这里面哪匹马可能会拿第一名，\n希望能告诉我一下呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e324602f5d3f807fefa8fc0ce8e30c1673c1bca0437a806f8f05af19c3e3023",
      "text": "真、真的凭直觉就行吗？\n那个……那就这匹吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bfc11190d804da5bf8e5efebcfec88e0a579237a18b4f24bd5dc14805f306fb",
      "text": "哦，“无限梦想”啊。\n选了个挺有意思的冷门嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ea2a930db820b467311705202fff4849a20d8a6c9aa4b6b404bd393416c6860",
      "text": "那个……虽然很想看到最后的结果，\n但我还有下一份工作……抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7680f3ad2736b860c5fba7fcbe2f3c9f7561cdd69b7aa321b2ca8f944dc65055",
      "text": "哎呀，是我耽误你了才对，不好意思啊。\n那路上小心哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
